// SYNTAX TEST "source.pibbles" "choices, markup and points"

== inline
-> Use the key  @if $has_key @once #show_disabled #id:m3xw9a
// <-- meta.option.pibbles keyword.control.option.pibbles
//              ^^^ keyword.control.modifier.pibbles
//                  ^^^^^^^^ variable.other.pibbles
//                           ^^^^^ keyword.control.modifier.pibbles
//                                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ meta.tag.pibbles entity.name.tag.pibbles
//                                                ^^^^^^^^^^ comment.other.line-id.pibbles
    mira: Got it!
-> Email me \@ home, or @ the office
//          ^^ constant.character.escape.pibbles
//                      ^ - keyword.control.modifier.pibbles

mira: That's [b]not[/b] a [wave amplitude=2 frequency=$speed]key[/wave].
//           ^ meta.markup.pibbles punctuation.definition.markup.pibbles
//            ^ entity.name.tag.markup.pibbles
//             ^ punctuation.definition.markup.pibbles
//                 ^^ punctuation.definition.markup.pibbles
//                              ^^^^^^^^^ variable.parameter.pibbles
//                                        ^ constant.numeric.pibbles
//                                                    ^^^^^^ variable.other.pibbles
mira: Hi, {$player_name}. You have {item_name("key")}.{w}{w 0.5}{p}{br}
//        ^ meta.point.pibbles punctuation.definition.point.pibbles
//         ^^^^^^^^^^^^ variable.other.pibbles
//                     ^ punctuation.definition.point.pibbles
//                                  ^^^^^^^^^ entity.name.function.pibbles
//                                                     ^ keyword.other.point.pibbles
//                                                        ^ keyword.other.point.pibbles
//                                                               ^ keyword.other.point.pibbles
//                                                                  ^^ keyword.other.point.pibbles
mira: Press {icon interact}.{@jolt mira wait}
//           ^^^^ keyword.other.point.pibbles
//                ^^^^^^^^ constant.other.icon.pibbles
//                           ^^^^^ entity.name.function.command.pibbles
//                                      ^^^^ keyword.other.wait.pibbles
rex: You {if $bravery > 2}hit it{elif $bravery > 0}touched it{else}didn't{/if}.
//        ^^ keyword.control.conditional.pibbles
//                               ^^^^ keyword.control.conditional.pibbles
//                                                            ^^^^ keyword.control.conditional.pibbles
//                                                                        ^^^ keyword.control.conditional.pibbles
mira: Very {speed 0.3}slowly{speed} now.
//          ^^^^^ keyword.other.point.pibbles
//                ^^^ constant.numeric.pibbles
//                           ^^^^^ keyword.other.point.pibbles
